# {{project_name}}

This project uses [Nomad](https://github.com/jfbilodeau/Nomad) {{nomad_version}}.

## Development

Check the project:

```console
./nomadw check
```

Run the project:

```console
./nomadw run
```

On Windows, use `nomadw.cmd` instead. The wrapper installs the exact Nomad SDK
selected by `nomad.toml` when it is not already available, after asking for
permission. Set `NOMAD_DOWNLOAD_POLICY=allow` to approve installation in
automated environments or `NOMAD_DOWNLOAD_POLICY=never` to prohibit downloads.
